  "comment": "Weapon power (Wave Editor «Оружие»). Applied at game start onto DA_Weapon_* Stats (the unified weapon schema, docs/design/WEAPONS_FRAMEWORK.md; validated, an invalid weapon block is rejected) and the squad's grenades. Metres / seconds.",
