    "exponent": 2
  },
  "armor": {
    "comment": "Armour per body (game designer decision 1, 2026-11-08): class none / light / medium / heavy / vehicle + the share of damage it stops (multiplicative with the weapon's armor_penetration). A weapon whose penetration_class is below the body's class gets NO armor_penetration against it. 'operative' = the squad and the PMC fighters; the rest are the enemy archetypes. The APC hull keeps its own factors (vehicle_weapons.apc_hull).",
