  "roster": {
    "comment": "The game designer's roster (2026-11-08): the only weapons in the game are the ones he names. in_play = in the game now; next = the order they are made real (shotgun, pistol, sniper rifle + RPG-7); out = removed from play (never in an arsenal, no loot, no ammo item; a save holding one loads without it, the M16 in hands). Their DA_Weapon_* assets stay on disk unreferenced. The pistol and the sniper rifle keep their current data and places until they are remade on the framework.",
